## 2.0 Beta

### What's new

- Completely reworked the tool structure
- Reworked HTTP response analysis
- Added HTTP status code analysis
- Added final URL detection
- Added server detection
- Added Content-Type detection
- Added response size calculation
- Added cookie detection and count
- Added redirect detection
- Added HTTP methods detection via OPTIONS
- Improved error handling
- Removed unused functions

### Coming in 2.0

- File saving system
- HTML response saving
- Headers export
- Cookie export
- JSON analysis reports
- Improved output formatting